//  NerdFontConstraints.swift
//  Per-codepoint scaling rules for Nerd Font icons.
//
//  Transpiled from libghostty's `src/font/nerd_font_attributes.zig`, which is
//  itself generated from the nerd-fonts patcher script. DO NOT EDIT BY HAND —
//  regenerate from the same source if the ghostty pin moves.
//
//  Nerd Font glyphs are drawn at wildly different natural sizes and the
//  patcher script normalizes them per icon family. A terminal that renders an
//  *unpatched* Nerd Font (which is what you get when the system font fallback
//  finds one) has to apply the same normalization itself, or the icons come
//  out at whatever size the designer happened to draw them.
//
//  The data is stored as flat numeric arrays rather than 413 struct
//  literals: homogeneous literal arrays cost the Swift type checker nothing,
//  and lookups binary search a sorted, non-overlapping range table.

